    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The quiet light of dawn awakens The Gardens. I count 12 presences, each engaged in their own way. Nearby, Cliff Songsmith the gardener hums softly. tawny leaves tumble on the wind.</description>
